  "body": "A generic URL pattern match library would most logically fit into the URL Standard I think, especially if we want to more deeply consider shorthand syntax and such.\r\n\r\nGiven that scope it might also be worth adjusting the name and such some. At least from the meeting it seemed clear that beyond service worker scope, filtering in the service worker fetch event was also considered an important use case with somewhat different requirements.",
